ence\">Quality Intelligence +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Quality Intelligence +1</a></b>: This item focuses the power of the wearer's mind, granting a +1 <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to Intelligence.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Dread_Isle&#39;s_Curse\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Dread Isle's Curse</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Dread_Isle&#39;s_Curse\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Dread Isle's Curse</a>:</b> 5 Pieces Equipped:<br />+5 <a href=\"/page/Profane_bonus\" title=\"Profane bonus\">Profane bonus</a> to Melee and Ranged Power<br />+10 Profane bonus to Universal Spellpower<br />+10 Profane bonus to Physical Resistance Rating<br />+1 Profane bonus to Spell DCs<br />+1 Profane bonus to all Ability Scores<br /><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">The Isle of Dread beckons you...</span></span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.pur